[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3189800564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109234#issuecomment-3189800564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109234","id":3189800564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-IH50","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T20:34:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T20:34:44Z","body":"You can't just assume that any added main screen will have associated shortcut (and with half-hard-coded path). You could add a method to EditorMainScreen that assigns a Shortcut to a main screen Button based on its name.\r\n\r\nIdeally we should have some API that allows defining a shortcut for a main screen plugin, but this is out of scope for this PR.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3189800564/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191172880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109234#issuecomment-3191172880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109234","id":3191172880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-NW8Q","user":{"login":"kushagra10025","id":53115703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTE1NzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53115703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025","html_url":"https://github.com/kushagra10025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T10:12:50Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T10:12:50Z","body":"Have handled the scenario for Custom Plugins - Though due to how `ED_GET_SHORTCUT` works, there will be an error like `INTERNAL ERROR: Used ED_GET_SHORTCUT with invalid shortcut: editor/editor_XXXX` for every custom plugin added - For the first time. Once the Shortcut path is created error won't popup again, and users can setup custom path - Can serve as a reminder to add shortcut to custom plugins.\r\n\r\nHere's the new change in action (with two custom plugins - one enabled by default and one to be manually enabled) \r\nPS: Error apart from INTERNAL ERROR are due to incompatible LimboAI version, kindly ignore (unless otherwise :) )\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb6e086d-0054-4621-9b91-ac5290a1836d\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191172880/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191229548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109234#issuecomment-3191229548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109234","id":3191229548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Nkxs","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T10:43:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T10:43:53Z","body":"> Have handled the scenario for Custom Plugins - Though due to how ED_GET_SHORTCUT works, there will be an error like INTERNAL ERROR: Used ED_GET_SHORTCUT with invalid shortcut: editor/editor_XXXX for every custom plugin added - For the first time. Once the Shortcut path is created error won't popup again, and users can setup custom path - Can serve as a reminder to add shortcut to custom plugins.\r\n\r\nUh, that will just cause errors for every main screen plugin and people will make bug reports. Also forcing a fixed path for plugin can easily cause other problems, like name clashes.\r\n\r\nIf you want to go this way, just check if the shortcut exists before trying to assign it. If it does not exist, don't do anything, don't add a dummy shortcut.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191229548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191256610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109234#issuecomment-3191256610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109234","id":3191256610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-NrYi","user":{"login":"kushagra10025","id":53115703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTE1NzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53115703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025","html_url":"https://github.com/kushagra10025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T11:02:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T11:09:00Z","body":"Thanks for pointing these out.\r\n\r\n`Uh, that will just cause errors for every main screen plugin and people will make bug reports.`\r\nYes to this, any new custom main screen plugin is added, it will throw an error - unless the shortcut path creation for that plugin is handled by the plugin itself - but then a way would be needed to ensure the shortcut path follows the string comparision format.\r\n\r\n`Also forcing a fixed path for plugin can easily cause other problems, like name clashes.`\r\nHad thought of this, but I didn't have a alternative to this, if two plugin names are same then that becomes an issue - is there any way to ensure that no two editorplugins have clashing names?\r\n\r\n`If it does not exist, don't do anything, don't add a dummy shortcut.`\r\nThis would be the simplest way ahead, but wouldn't it cause inconsistency where the Core Main Screen plugins have a shortcut and its tooltip and the custom ones don't. If this is fine, I can remove the new shortcut path creation code and raise it again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191256610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191346241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109234#issuecomment-3191346241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109234","id":3191346241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-OBRB","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T11:58:34Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T11:58:34Z","body":"> This would be the simplest way ahead, but wouldn't it cause inconsistency where the Core Main Screen plugins have a shortcut and its tooltip and the custom ones don't.\r\n\r\nWell, that's just missing functionality. I doubt most people will even notice it.\r\nAlso core main screen plugins had a shortcut for a long time already, so it's not that big change.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191346241/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191386482","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109234#issuecomment-3191386482","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109234","id":3191386482,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-OLFy","user":{"login":"kushagra10025","id":53115703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTE1NzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53115703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025","html_url":"https://github.com/kushagra10025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kushagra10025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T12:24:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T12:24:14Z","body":"ah alright, in that case will update the code to reflect this.\r\n\r\nbut here's a concern I've - this is what the updated code block would look like\r\n```\r\nRef<Shortcut> shortcut = ED_GET_SHORTCUT(String(\"editor/editor_{0}\").format(varray(p_editor->get_plugin_name().to_lower())));\r\nif (!shortcut.is_null() && shortcut.is_valid()) {\r\n\ttb->set_shortcut(shortcut);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nbased on how the code is structured, it would still look for custom plugin shortcut_paths, say `editor/editor_limboai` and find it missing and will eventually throw the INTERNAL ERROR due to ED_GET_SHORTCUT\r\n\r\nalternative to this would be handling the get_shortcut check with `EditorSettings::get_singleton()->get_shortcut(p_path);`\r\nbut is it recommended and if yes, can the previous approach of creating and exposing a custom plugins shortcut path viable - obviously with a message to the user in console that a shortcut is available, if they want to use it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191386482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3191388684","html_url":"ht